              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahakuba omuriwe tuba abahuriire, tugyenda, kandi tugumaho; nk'abamwe aha bahimbi baanyu b'ebyoshongoro oku baagambire nibagira bati: Ahakuba naitwe turi oruzaaro rwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
