        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo ku turaabe turi oruzaaro rwa Ruhanga, tutushemereire kuteekateeka ngu Ruhanga naashusha ezaabu nari efeeza, nari amabaare agasharwire omu buringaringo n'obwengye bw'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
